sts led by the charming mr  wolf once they accidentally get pictured  doing a good deed during one of their  schemes the team has roped into trying  to reform themselves as good guys in  order to atone for their crimes the bad  guys has filled with witty humor  interesting animation and lots of  exciting action that serves to make this  one of the higher rated animated movies  of the year more than anything many seem  to agree that the film is genuinely  funny for both kids and adults  it's time to talk about the minions with  the recent release of minions the rise  of crew the world has once again been  graced for the big screen presence of  everyone's favorite little yellow banana  loving trouble makers that's the latest  in the despicable me and minions  franchise this film serves as a sequel  to the first standalone minions film  while also simultaneously being a  prequel to the first despicable me  feature illumination entertainment has  managed to create some of the most  iconic animated characters of all time  and the film was a financial smash the  rise of gru takes place in 1975 and  serves to explain how the minions came  to serve the villainous crew who is only  a kid at this time brew and the minions  are roped into a conflict between the  villainous six and their former leader  named wild knuckles as they struggle to  collect the zodiac stone minions a rise  of gru is full of the kind of  minion-based shenanigans that the series  has become known for with lots of  yelling cartoon violence laughing and  banana enjoyment this film also sparked  some real-life comedy when thousands of  moviegoers around the world made it a  meme to see the movie dressed to the  nines in suits calling themselves gentle  minions  fire island is a delightful romantic  comedy about a group of gay men  vacationing on fire island off the coast  of long island while the story is  inspired by pride and prejudice  things get more complicated as the men  navigate romances rivalries 